  nodeId: Interview Victor
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "The camera cuts to Victor Hasting, the Chief Security Officer. He's
    a large, rigid man sitting with his arms crossed. He looks more annoyed by the
    disruption to his security protocols than devastated by his boss's death.\r\n\r\n<b>[DEDUCTION
    CLIPBOARD ACTIVE]</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>You currently have no physical clues
    to present. Select a baseline topic for Detective Miller to press her on.</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Detective
    Miller:</b>\r\n\"He's completely walled up behind his own security protocols.
    We need the actual logs to punch a hole in this.\"\r\n\r\n<i>[VICTOR HASTING'S
    STATEMENT LOGGED]</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
  category: 0
  requiredClue: {fileID: 0}
  clueRevealed: {fileID: 0}
